;width: 6px;height: 8px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-style: solid none solid solid;border-width: 2px 1px 1px 2px;border-color: rgb(102, 72, 62) rgb(255, 64, 64) rgb(102, 72, 62) rgb(102, 72, 62);\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\"></svg></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><br  /></p><section style=\"text-align: center;color: rgb(102, 72, 62);\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p><strong>公测活动正在进行，快来领开荒英雄！</strong></p></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><br  /></p><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 9%;height: auto;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.8982035928143712\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/LHdtlaBo22eaBNrDcyP2Diaz6k2gFw16yN7nhrCWSbRrXIVDIXpH3ejLyMH2r62y1aKcgM57icU5FFTY5CHKZOrCWC5nmby2EL/640?wx_fmt=svg\" data-type=\"svg\" data-w=\"167\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;height: 100%;\"  /></section></section><section style=\"color: rgb(102, 72, 62);\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\"><strong>参与方式</strong></span><br  /></p></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><br  /></p><section style=\"text-align: center;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(102, 72, 62);\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\"><strong>①</strong></span><br  /></section><section style=\"line-height: 2em;\">进入《霸业》公众号</section><section style=\"line-height: 2em;\">菜单栏【<span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\">首发中心-公测活动</span>】</section><section style=\"line-height: 2em;\">点击跳转即可参与</section><p><br  /></p><section style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\">②</span></strong></section><section style=\"line-height: 2em;\">点击下方“<span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\">阅读原文</span>”进入活动</section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><br  /></p><section style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row nowrap;margin: 7px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;flex: 100 100 0%;align-self: flex-start;height: auto;border-width: 0px;line-height: 0;z-index: 1;padding-right: 4px;\"><section style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row nowrap;text-align: justify;justify-content: flex-start;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;flex: 100 100 0%;align-self: flex-start;height: auto;border-top: 2px solid rgb(102, 72, 62);border-top-left-radius: 0px;\"><section style=\"text-align: right;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 10px;height: 10px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-style: none none solid solid;border-width: 1px 0px 2px 2px;border-color: rgb(255, 64, 64) rgb(255, 64, 64) rgb(102, 72, 62) rgb(102, 72, 62);\"><section style=\"margin-top: 3px;margin-right: 0%;margin-left: 0%;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 6px;height: 8px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-style: solid solid solid none;border-width: 2px 2px 1px 0px;border-color: rgb(102, 72, 62) rgb(102, 72, 62) rgb(102, 72, 62) rgb(255, 64, 64);\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\"></svg></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: flex-start;flex: 100 100 0%;line-height: 0;letter-spacing: 0px;z-index: 1;padding-left: 4px;\"><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px);transform-style: flat;